psy or genetic testing if clinically appropriate\n\n**Important note**\nThis is a preliminary pipeline signal, not an actual diagnosis. A radiologist/urologist/oncology team would still need to confirm what this scan represents.\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/b0f1c107-0576-49f4-985a-1754b3411728.jpeg\n\nIf you want, I can also give you:\n- a **clean patient-friendly report**, or\n- the **raw JSON response only**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0979c4ed41283d220169bbfdf0db0c81918c11fc2a627f35a9\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":467,"output":543,"cacheRead":37248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38258,"cost":{"input":0.0011675000000000001,"output":0.008145,"cacheRead":0.009311999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0186245}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773927916622}}
